#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.read_parquet.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.read\\_parquet"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_parquet.read_parquet:1 of
msgid "Read a parquet file into a LiteFrame with Arrow dtypes."
msgstr "使用 Arrow 数据类型从 parquet 文件读取到 LiteFrame 中。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_parquet.read_parquet:3 of
msgid ""
"Local (``file://`` or bare path) files are read with pandas and wrapped "
"via :func:`from_local_df`. Remote paths are read in chunks by the "
"MaxFrame backend; when a ``session`` is available the schema is inferred "
"remotely, otherwise the tiler infers types from the Parquet file's built-"
"in schema metadata at execution time."
msgstr ""
"本地（``file://`` 或裸路径）文件使用 pandas 读取并通过 :func:`from_local_"
"df` 包装。远程路径由 MaxFrame 后端分块读取；当 ``session`` 可用时，模式会"
"在远程推断，否则在执行时根据 Parquet 文件的内置模式元数据进行类型推断。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.read_parquet.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_parquet.read_parquet:9 of
msgid ""
"Path or list of paths to the parquet file(s) to read. Local paths and "
"remote URIs are both supported."
msgstr "要读取的 parquet 文件的路径或路径列表。支持本地路径和远程 URI。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_parquet.read_parquet:12 of
msgid "Column names to select. If None, all columns are read."
msgstr "要选择的列名。如果为 None，则读取所有列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_parquet.read_parquet:14 of
msgid "Predicate filters to apply via parquet row-group pushdown."
msgstr "通过 parquet 行组下推应用的谓词过滤器。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_parquet.read_parquet:16 of
msgid ""
"Index type for the resulting LiteFrame. If None, a default is chosen by "
"the backend."
msgstr "结果 LiteFrame 的索引类型。如果为 None，则由后端选择默认值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_parquet.read_parquet:19 of
msgid "Extra options for the storage backend (e.g. credentials)."
msgstr "存储后端的额外选项（例如凭证）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_parquet.read_parquet:21 of
msgid "Target chunk size in bytes for splitting remote files."
msgstr "拆分远程文件的目标块大小（字节）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_parquet.read_parquet:23 of
msgid "Whether to merge small files into larger chunks."
msgstr "是否将小文件合并为更大的块。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_parquet.read_parquet:25 of
msgid "Whether to treat each parquet row group as a separate chunk."
msgstr "是否将每个 parquet 行组作为单独的块处理。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_parquet.read_parquet:27 of
msgid ""
"Session to use for remote schema inference and execution. If None, the "
"default session is used when available."
msgstr "用于远程模式推断和执行的会话。如果为 None，则在可用时使用默认会话。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_parquet.read_parquet:30 of
msgid "Additional keyword arguments forwarded to the parquet reader."
msgstr "转发给 parquet 读取器的附加关键字参数。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.read_parquet.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_parquet.read_parquet:32 of
msgid ""
"A lazy LiteFrame with Arrow dtypes representing the parquet data. Call "
"``.execute()`` to materialize the results."
msgstr ""
"一个使用 Arrow 数据类型的惰性 LiteFrame，表示 parquet 数据。调用 ``."
"execute()`` 来实例化结果。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.read_parquet.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_parquet.read_parquet:38 of
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame.to_parquet`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_parquet.read_parquet:39 of
msgid "Write a LiteFrame to a Parquet file."
msgstr "将 LiteFrame 写入 Parquet 文件。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_parquet.read_parquet:41 of
msgid ":py:obj:`read_csv`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_parquet.read_parquet:42 of
msgid "Read a CSV file into a LiteFrame."
msgstr "将 CSV 文件读取到 LiteFrame 中。"

